WEBVTT

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:36.050
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.820
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.600
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.330
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:47.040
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.620
For real? {maji...}

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.830
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:55.160
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:57.770
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:00.540
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.230
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.010
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:08.730
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.340
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.990
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.860
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.580
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.260
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.870
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.640
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:30.100
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.990
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.300
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.450
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:53.880
This is the report you asked me to submit about the Guardians at Seiyo Elementary.

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.960
As we thought, the one we need to watch is Hinamori Amu.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:00.840
She utilizes many different powers,

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:06.450
and I believe the secret to them surely lies in the Humpty Lock.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:11.480
I see. Well then, just take that lock.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.980
We might be able to use it for our next project.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:20.340
Get your hands on the Humpty Lock. That's your task this time.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:25.740
Hey, hey, Ikuto, she's up to something again-nya.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:26.950
It's none of my business.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:32.580
Guess so-nya. I'm gonna take a catnap, too.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:37.590
Episode 38
Key, Lock, He and I!

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:41.130
Jeez, Amu-chi, hurry up.

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:45.650
Yaya, you've got the Old Maid, haven't you?

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:46.470
Not telling.

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.810
It's written all over your face!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.410
No, it's not.

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:52.100
Fine, I've decided. This one!

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.590
It's the Old Maid, after all!

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.670
I guess this means Amu loses again.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.550
I suppose it's easy for Amu to pick the Old Maid because she's the Joker.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.850
Now you've gone and said it.

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:11.080
That's the lowest rank of humor.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.360
A joke that mustn't be spoken!

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:16.790
But I wasn't trying to make a joke.

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:22.200
Ah, I've always been completely useless at cards.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:28.240
Get your hands on the Humpty Lock. That's your task this time.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:34.540
The Chairman was staring at Amu-chi!

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.040
N-No, I wasn't!

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.250
Yes, you were.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.750
You were staring at her.

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.160
Were you, Sanjo-kun?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.860
I wasn't, really.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.410
Could it be love?

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:46.380
N-No way.

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:49.500
Is that true?

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.620
Stop it! You're bothering the Chairman!

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:56.110
Hey now, hey now, really?

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.740
Cut it out!

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.790
What is this complete lack of tension?

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.880
At this rate, my dream of world domination will remain just a dream!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.210
Here you go!

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.380
You guys!

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.310
Ah, you don't have to get so worked up.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:07.180
Silence!

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:11.560
In the first place, your very presence here is suspicious!

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.060
Why is an enemy Guardian Character here?

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:16.690
Because I can Character Transform with Amu.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.890
That is only due to the Humpty Lock.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:20.400
The Humpty Lock?

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.720
It's some mysterious power it possesses.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:28.580
However, even if you are able to Character Transform, for someone like you to...

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.620
Are you okay?

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:36.220
Kiseki, play with us!

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:37.250
Yeah!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.320
All of you, line up over there!

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.050
I have an important announcement to make!

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:43.300
Is he going to start again-dechu?

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.570
The King sure is selfish.

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.890
I'm home!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:02.300
Hey, Amu-chan, you don't have school tomorrow, right?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.490
Yeah, but...

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.180
Are you going out somewhere?

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.050
I haven't really made any plans.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.760
I'll just hang out at home.

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.730
A real bland Sunday, huh?

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.910
Oh, be quiet! Tomorrow, I'm planning to have some tea,

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.830
watch TV, and chill out as much as I can.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.510
I just decided now!

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.810
El, what are you doing?

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:23.940
What is it?

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:27.500
I just wonder why you have the lock, Amu-chan.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:28.820
That's because...

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:35.430
"Someday, someone special with three Guardian Eggs will appear. Keep this until that time comes."

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:40.830
The Founding King left this Humpty Lock with those words.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:42.890
So it was something like that.

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:46.240
The Humpty Lock is definitely something that you need, Amu-chan.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:49.210
We also have a strong bond with it.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:49.950
Yeah.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.550
Yeah, I suppose so.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:52.660
For sure!

00:05:52.990 --> 00:06:00.380
You guys seem pretty revved up, but I'm sleepy so I'm going to take a nap.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.650
Weren't you the one who started this conversation?

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:04.500
A free spirit, as usual.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.220
Ikuto-san, I'm coming in.

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:13.680
Again?

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:20.390
I just can't relax or feel at home in that house-nya.

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:21.600
Yeah.

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:29.500
When will you finally be able to open the door?

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.030
The Humpty Lock...

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:41.740
Your sister is late again tonight, isn't she?

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:44.840
The food you prepared so carefully will once again go to waste.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:49.190
It's fine. It's all things that can be reheated, anyway.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:52.570
Taking the lock...

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.280
For me to...

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:02.300
Kairi? Do you have the Humpty Lock yet?

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.000
No, not yet.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.490
How long are you going to take?

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:08.610
This isn't like you. I need it right away.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.190
I'm expecting it, got that?

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:12.330
I understand.

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:18.370
Sheesh, why is Kairi hesitating?

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.700
No problems with any of the checks.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:24.380
Okay. Can you finish up a quick sample for me, then?

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.960
Understood.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.250
All okay!

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.460
Good work!

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.040
Good work!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:38.280
Good work!

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:42.380
It looks like you're making good progress as well, Senpai!

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:45.380
Tsukumo, why are you here?

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:49.090
I came to report that we finished regulating the X Eggs' energy!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.100
If you want to report to me, just phone or e-mail!

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:56.530
But then you wouldn't be able to appropriately praise me!

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.540
It's finally started, hasn't it?

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.330
This project is on an entirely different scale from the ones before it.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.060
It's going to be a lot of fun! Right, Senpai?

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:12.360
Ah, that's right. I have a favor to ask of you, actually.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:18.100
If it's for you, Senpai, just say when and what and I'll gladly do it!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:18.840
Fine.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:19.450
Yes?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.580
{she says "de ne, sore de" here}Well, you see...

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:24.230
This sounds interesting!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.630
Did I fall asleep?

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.910
Looks like she didn't come home.

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:39.770
Her job sure is tough.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.970
She does work hard, in her own way.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.380
Chillin'.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.870
Chillin'.

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.250
Chillin'!

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:53.090
Bala-Balance!

00:08:56.020 --> 00:09:00.020
Amu-chan is hanging out, watching TV, just as she planned.

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:02.810
And that's the <i>only</i> thing she has planned.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:06.700
I want to chill out and watch TV like Amu-chan, too!

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:09.430
And why can't you?

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:12.200
Because of the King's orders.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.020
Then...

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:16.010
I don't feel like it, but...

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:17.360
Shall we go?

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:28.020
Is this okay, Kairi?

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:32.070
As long as the other Guardians aren't there, I think it'll be okay.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:32.710
Besides...

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:36.220
It's not like I'm asking you to steal it or anything.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.680
After we take some data, we'll return it.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.780
I'll just be borrowing it for a little while.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.010
Yes, this is the Hinamori residence!

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:47.350
Um, hello. My name is Sanjo.

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:50.150
Sis, telephone!

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:50.810
From who?

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:52.810
Your boyfriend!

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:55.480
Boyfriend?

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.150
Here.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.670
Yes, hello?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:01.530
Chairman?

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:04.940
Chairman? Her boyfriend's the Chairman?

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:07.350
The Chairman? The Chairman?!

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:12.620
The Guardian Character meeting shall now commence!

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:15.610
We can no longer rely on those slackard Guardians!

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.040
For it is now that we-

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:20.730
Hey, listen to me!

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:22.930
Musashi hasn't come yet-dechu.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:26.770
Until Musashi shows up, watch my acrobatics!

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.730
That damn Musashi. When he shows up, I'll teach him a thing or two!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:34.730
Chairman!

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:38.710
I-I'm sorry for calling you out here so suddenly.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:42.240
Did you bring the Humpty Lock with you?

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:44.740
U-Um...

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:49.000
I just really want to research it!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.830
I'm sure it can be of some use to power up the Guardians.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.880
Well, you see...

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.350
Bala-Balance!

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:00.180
That's enough!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.330
We're starting without Musashi!

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:06.470
But before that, why are <i>you</i> here?

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:12.590
This is an important meeting regarding world domination and finding the Embryo!

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:14.940
This is not a place for someone like <i>you</i> to be!

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.450
You should not say such harsh things.

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:19.370
What are you talking about-dechu?

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:20.550
Yeah!

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:23.280
It's more fun with everyone here!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:26.320
There is no need for it to be <i>fun!</i>

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:30.040
But I want to find the Embryo, too, no matter what.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.250
That's why I brought this.

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:35.830
Isn't that the Humpty Lock?

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:37.760
You just took it without asking?

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.420
Amu-chan will be angry!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.930
The Humpty Lock has a mysterious power.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:47.290
If I combine it with my power, I'm sure we can find the Embryo!

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.930
You think it'll be that simple?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:53.490
If we find the Embryo, I'm sure everyone can be happy.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.540
Even Utau-chan.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:58.820
That's why I want to search for the Embryo with everyone else!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.770
Fine, if you'd go that far, I guess we have no choice.

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:07.120
And the Humpty Lock does seem to be of some use.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:12.890
Huh? The Humpty Lock wasn't there?

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:15.500
One of them probably took it.

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:19.430
They seem to have gone somewhere. I couldn't find them in the house.

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:20.170
Damn.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:23.780
Oh yes, if it's them, then today...

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:25.710
Musashi, you know where they are?

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.550
They're having an important meeting in the Royal Garden for some reason.

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.870
Shouldn't you have gone, Musashi?

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:33.640
I'm doing my best to help Yukari-senpai!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.680
Ikuto!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:47.120
I'm bored-nya!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.540
I've got nothing to do!

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.480
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:50.480
You're noisy.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:56.450
I guess I'll just have to go play by myself-nya.

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:08.610
The Humpty Lock.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:19.900
Should I try it?

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:24.510
Now then, let us search for the Embryo!

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.440
Yeah!

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:27.730
Who's there?

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:31.060
You ain't gonna find the Embryo that easily!

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:32.080
Il!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:36.860
Sucking up to these losers, are you? I guess you're a total traitor now.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:40.420
N-No. To help Utau-chan, I'm just-

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:41.410
Shut up!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.340
El!

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:45.510
I'm super lucky El brought this here for me.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.830
Il'll be takin' this lock.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.210
I'll be takin' this lock-nya!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:52.130
Yoru! Give that back, you!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.380
Loyal subjects, retrieve that lock!

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:57.450
You should work, too, Kiseki-dechu.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.060
What is this?

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:08.880
Ran, what's the matter?

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.610
Amu-chan.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:11.270
Ran!

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:19.460
I'll be takin' this lock-nya.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:20.530
Kick!

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:27.670
El, if you have that lock, Utau might forgive you.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.210
You might even be able to Character Transform with her.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:35.720
But, this is Amu-chan's.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:40.230
It's the power that can save Utau-chan from the evil path she's on.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:43.210
So I'm not giving it to you!

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:43.470
Say what?

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:51.210
You're always such a goody two-shoes, it pisses me off!

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:52.330
Let go of the lock!

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:53.210
You first!

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:53.210
No way!

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:53.940
What are you doing?

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.960
Oh, Musashi.

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:59.320
I'll remember this!

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:06.870
Not exactly the way we planned to get it, is it?

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:11.510
What is it, Kairi?

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.400
I can't do it.

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.810
I just can't give this to Easter.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.460
Yoink.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.630
Spin!

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.630
Please give that back!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:23.300
No need to worry. This is something your sister asked me to do.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:25.460
Yukari-neesan asked you to?

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.740
She told me to follow you.

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.870
I'll go give this to her now.

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:32.770
You can call me "big brother" from now on!

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.980
And with that, I'm off!

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:38.880
Mission over, huh?

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:42.160
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.350
Nice work.

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:03.190
He's got the lock, now what'll we do-nya?

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.310
Ikuto!

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:06.220
Amu.

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:07.720
Did you take it again?

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:10.220
The guy with the lock is over there-nya!

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:14.280
We're going after them, Yoru.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.190
Okay!

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:27.510
So Ikuto didn't take it.

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.660
Amu-chan!

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:29.380
Right!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.080
Let's Character Transform.

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:33.410
My heart:

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.240
Unlock!

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:38.140
Huh?

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.630
Without the lock...

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.180
We can't Character Transform!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.460
What'll we do?!

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.640
We got the lock-nya!

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:42.570
The lock and Amu are calling each other?

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:49.240
Even though I Character Changed, that's as far as I can go.

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:59.370
Hey, what are you doing?

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:10.340
The Humpty Lock.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.930
His eyelashes are so long.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:20.970
So this is what men's shampoo smells like.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:24.440
It's different from mine or the one Dad uses.

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:28.690
What am I thinking at a time like this?

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.450
Should we try?

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.570
The Dumpty Key?

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.860
It seems like quite a tight fit.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.070
Will it go in?

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.150
Wh-What is this?

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:53.720
I-It's...

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:14.410
Stop, I'm scared!

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:22.540
Ah, I knew it wouldn't go in.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.980
It won't fit in the keyhole.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.140
What are you so embarrassed about, little girl?

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:32.140
Absolutely nothing, you dirty old man!

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:35.090
Is it not time yet?

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.390
See you later, you pervy brat.

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:40.190
Why are you giving it back to me?

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:41.430
Haven't you always been trying to get it?

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:46.440
You can keep it for now.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:50.940
But what just happened?

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.740
Beats me.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:11.310
Amu-chan, it's good you got the lock back.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:16.090
Speaking of which, why did you guys take it without permission?

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:17.300
Um...

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:19.840
I won't accept any excuses!

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.810
But it's not our fault!

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:25.100
Man, that was scary.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:30.330
This cat-eared ghost suddenly appeared, and before I knew it the lock had...

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.970
I'm sorry, Yukari-senpai.

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:36.220
That selfish cat's capriciousness sure can be a problem.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:40.430
No matter, we'll have other chances to get the Humpty Lock.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.920
Sis, I...

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:45.960
It's completed, isn't it, Senpai?

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:46.430
That's...

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:51.420
Your new mission, Kairi.

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:01.970
The lock and key draw ever closer.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:06.890
I wonder if the stars will move?

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:19.180
I wonder what that was.

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:21.740
Nothing happened when Yoru tried it, but this time...

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:31.580
Ikuto should have sensed that world, too.

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:35.710
Didn't you guys sense it?

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:36.880
Sense what?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:40.160
Never mind, it's nothing.

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:47.410
The Humpty Lock and the Dumpty Key... Ikuto and I...

00:21:49.180 --> 00:21:50.490
I want to know.

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:56.280
I want to know more about Ikuto.

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:40.630
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:44.010
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:50.310
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.310 --> 00:22:52.550
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:57.500
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.830
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.490 --> 00:23:05.390
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.390 --> 00:23:09.160
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:12.770
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:12.770 --> 00:23:16.140
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.140 --> 00:23:20.050
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:23.300
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:27.300
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:30.550
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:34.530
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:39.230
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.470 --> 00:23:48.670
I won first place today, of course!

00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:52.440
This was in my bag, but...

00:23:52.440 --> 00:23:56.870
I know what that is! It's the teaser CD everyone at school's talking about!

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:58.020
Teaser CD?

00:23:58.020 --> 00:23:59.820
It's supposed to grant any wish!

00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:01.090
For real?

00:24:01.090 --> 00:24:03.270
If she's making a face like this...

00:24:03.270 --> 00:24:05.360
She must be considering it.

00:24:05.360 --> 00:24:09.590
Anyway, I have a bad feeling about that CD.

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:11.020
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.020 --> 00:24:12.860
Character Transformation! Platinum Royal!

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:14.410
Platinum Royal?

00:24:14.410 --> 00:24:17.080
Could the moment I've been waiting for finally have come?

00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:18.740
Let's go, Tadase!
